# deploy/.gitignore excludes *.sql from this whole tree, because the failure
# mode worth preventing is a raw production dump being committed by accident.
#
# These two are the deliberate exceptions:
#
#   sanitise.sql   the transform, which is the reviewable artifact
#   dev-seed.sql   its output, which has passed
#                  scripts/check_dev_seed_sanitised.py
#
# Nothing else. A dump dropped in this directory to run the build script stays
# untracked, which is the point.
!sanitise.sql
!dev-seed.sql
